 "timestamp_updated": 1673218019, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130463823", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989388330", "personaname": "HotBeef", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197989388330/", "num_games_owned": 324, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 509, "last_played": 1673215024, "avatar": "4dd8bb818e254045e084f81dd07eacb19f1f92b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "If this game didn't have a smooth frame rate, it would go down as one of the worst \"AAA\" games ever made. So many stupid basic things that are missing. Every gun feels the same, shoots like a laser 0 recoil. YOU CANT SWAP ATTACHMENTS. Oops you picked up a 8x by accident... looks like you gotta swap guns now... The \"base\" game was less than 3 hrs of content. They reuse the same assets for the first 5 acts of the game. Spawn in the same room run past the same gas station down the same city street for 10 levels. Some levels are so short you literally walk down the street and turn and the safe room is right there. I could literally nit pick all the stupid ♥♥♥♥ that makes this game garbage and write an essay about it. Criminal this game was 60$ I feel robbed paying 20$. Forgot about the joke of a story.... Pathetic how this game was advertised. TLDR : Play any other 4 player coop game.", "timestamp_created": 1673215495, "timestamp_updated": 1673215543, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "16